  "description": "AVINOX M2S\n\nThe M2S motor delivers 150 Nm of torque, offering strong, progressive power that allows you to tackle steep climbs and technical trails with total confidence.\n\nIt also reaches up to 1300 W of peak power in Turbo mode, giving an instant response when you need it most and taking motor assistance to the highest level.\n\n800WH | LONG RANGE\n\nEquipped with an 800 Wh battery, providing up to 157 km of range.\n\nTRAIL | 140 MM TRAVEL\n\nExperience the perfect balance with our 140 mm travel e-MTB, designed to enjoy every type of trail with agility, control and confidence.\n\nEvery climb, every corner and every descent becomes a unique experience thanks to a suspension system and geometry that deliver a smooth, stable and fun ride.\n\nINTEGRATED DISPLAY + LEFT/RIGHT WIRELESS CONTROLLERS\n\nThe 2” OLED touchscreen, fully integrated into the frame, delivers exceptional visibility in any condition.\n\nComplemented by wireless handlebar controllers, it creates a clean, minimalist cockpit ready for a superior riding experience.",
